msgid "![Histogram of the bitstrings sampled from the Krylov circuits, showing a small support.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/skqd-16.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Histogram of the bitstrings sampled from the Krylov circuits, showing a small support.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/skqd-16.avif)\n"

